the backflip and lands in a three-point crouch on a flooded rooftop, one metallic hand and both boots splashing into the reflective water; a brief shockwave of water and neon reflection ripples outward. [Shot 3] At 00:04.800, the shot switches to a fast tracking shot from behind as she rises and sprints down a narrow alley lined with cyan and magenta neon signs, her coat streaming behind her; she rounds a corner at 00:05.400 and dissolves into the crowd and holographic glare, gone by 00:06.000.\n\noverall_soundscape: High-altitude wind roars and intensifies into a rushing fall, layered with the flutter of a transparent coat and faint mechanical servo whine from the prosthetic arm. A sharp splash and metallic footfall punctuate the landing, followed by rapid wet footsteps echoing down the alley before they cut off.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: A dark synthwave bass pulse at a fast tempo, joined by a driving arpeggiator that swells during the fall and drops sharply on impact, then fades with the sprint."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 232, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [310], "label": "模型", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "模型"}], "size": [333.5187683105469, 94.44976043701172], "pos": [-1821.5606689453125, 4911.177734375], "widgets_values": ["minimax_h3_fl2va_int8_convrot.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "UNET名称"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "剪枝类型"}], "flags": {}, "id": 127, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "models": [{"name": "minimax_h3_ref2va_pruned_int8_convrot.safet